<title>USA: Fort Lauderdale, Fla., approves park bonds.</title>
<headline>Fort Lauderdale, Fla., approves park bonds.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fort Lauderdale, Fla., approved a $35 million general obligation bond issue in Tuesday's election, Broward County elections officials said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The proposal passed with 28,709 votes and 13,207 no votes, or a margin of about three to one.</p>
<p>--Jane Sutton, 305-374-53</p>
</text>
